{"speciesId":212,"names":{"fr":"Cizayox","es":"Scizor","en":"Scizor","ja":"ハッサム"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"It swings its eye- patterned pincers up to scare its foes. This makes it look like it has three heads."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"Its wings are not used for flying. They are flapped at high speed to adjust its body temperature."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"This POKéMON's pincers, which contain steel, can crush any hard object it gets a hold of into bits."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"SCIZOR has a body with the hardness of steel. It is not easily fazed by ordinary sorts of attacks. This POKéMON flaps its wings to regulate its body temperature."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"SCIZOR has a body with the hardness of steel. It is not easily fazed by ordinary sorts of attacks. This POKéMON flaps its wings to regulate its body temperature."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"A SCIZOR has a body with the hardness of steel. It is not easily fazed by ordinary sorts of attacks. It flaps its wings to regulate its body temperature."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"Its wings are not used for flying. They are flapped at high speed to adjust its body temperature."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It swings its eye-patterned pincers up to scare its foes. This makes it look like it has three heads."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It has a steel-hard body. It intimidates foes by upraising its eye-patterned pincers."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It has a steel-hard body. It intimidates foes by upraising its eye-patterned pincers."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It raises its pincers with eyelike markings for intimidation. It also swings them down dangerously."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It swings its eye-patterned pincers up to scare its foes. This makes it look like it has three heads."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its wings are not used for flying. They are flapped at high speed to adjust its body temperature."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Les yeux sur ses pinces servent à intimider l’ennemi avant de passer à l’attaque."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It raises its pincers with eyelike markings for intimidation. It also swings them down dangerously."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Les yeux sur ses pinces servent à intimider l’ennemi avant de passer à l’attaque."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It raises its pincers with eyelike markings for intimidation. It also swings them down dangerously."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It raises its pincers with eyelike markings for intimidation. It also swings them down dangerously."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It raises its pincers with eyelike markings for intimidation. It also swings them down dangerously."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Les pinces de ce Pokémon contiennent de l’acier et peuvent réduire en miettes quasiment n’importe quoi."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Las pinzas que posee tienen acero. Con ellas, no hay nada que se le resista. Rompen todo lo que pillan."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"This Pokémon’s pincers, which contain steel, can crush any hard object it gets ahold of into bits."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"鋼鉄を 含んでいる ハサミで 捕らえたものは どんなに 硬くても コナゴナに 砕く。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Son corps est dur comme l’acier. Il intimide ses ennemis en levant ses pinces pareilles à des yeux."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Su cuerpo es duro como el acero. Confunde a los rivales con los dibujos de ojos en sus pinzas."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It has a steel-hard body. It intimidates foes by upraising its eye-patterned pincers."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"鋼の 体を 持つ。 目玉模様の ついた ハサミを 振り上げて 相手を 威嚇する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Le corps de Cizayox est dur comme de l’acier. Les attaques ordinaires ne le déstabilisent pas. Ce Pokémon bat des ailes pour réguler sa température interne."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Scizor tiene un cuerpo duro como el acero que no es fácil de alterar con ningún ataque común. Este Pokémon bate las alas para regular la temperatura corporal."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Scizor has a body with the hardness of steel. It is not easily fazed by ordinary sorts of attacks. This Pokémon flaps its wings to regulate its body temperature."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"鋼の 硬さを 持つ 体は ちょっとや そっとの 攻撃では びくとも しないぞ。 ハネを 羽ばたかせ 体温を 調節する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Le corps de Cizayox est dur comme de l’acier. Les attaques ordinaires ne le déstabilisent pas. Ce Pokémon bat des ailes pour réguler sa température interne."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Scizor tiene un cuerpo duro como el acero que no es fácil de alterar con ningún ataque común. Este Pokémon bate las alas para regular la temperatura corporal."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Scizor has a body with the hardness of steel. It is not easily fazed by ordinary sorts of attacks. This Pokémon flaps its wings to regulate its body temperature."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"鋼の 硬さを 持つ 体は ちょっとや そっとの 攻撃では びくとも しないぞ。 ハネを 羽ばたかせ 体温を 調節する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il utilise ses ailes pour réguler sa température corporelle, ce qui empêche sa carcasse d’acier de fondre en cas d’ardent combat."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Este Pokémon bate las alas para regular su temperatura corporal y evitar que su cuerpo metálico se derrita en el fragor de la batalla."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"It uses its wings to adjust its body temperature. Otherwise, its metal body would become too hot and melt in the heat of battle."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"ハネを 使い 体温調節。 戦いで 熱くなり過ぎて 金属の 身体が 溶けないため。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Avec ses puissantes pinces d’acier, ce Pokémon implacable s’acharne sur tout ce qu’il considère comme un ennemi jusqu’à le briser."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Arremete contra sus enemigos con sus poderosas pinzas, tan duras como el acero, sin ningún tipo de compasión."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Once it has identified an enemy, this Pokémon smashes it mercilessly with pincers hard as steel."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"ひとたび 敵と 認識すると 鋼鉄の 硬度を 持つ ハサミで 容赦なく 叩き潰す。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Son corps est aussi solide que l’acier. Ses pinces, grosses et lourdes, sont plus adaptées au broyage qu’à la capture d’ennemis."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Su cuerpo es duro como el acero. Con sus pinzas grandes y pesadas, si agarra a un rival, más que inmovilizarlo lo destroza."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Its body is like steel. Its tough, heavy pincers are more suited to smashing enemies than grabbing them."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"鋼の ような 身体を 持つ。 ごつくて 重い ハサミは 敵を 挟むより 叩き潰すのに 向く。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Il utilise ses énormes pinces dures comme de l’acier pour réduire en miettes ceux qu’il identifie comme des ennemis."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Una vez que identifica a su enemigo, arremete contra él hasta hacerlo trizas con sus pinzas duras como el acero."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Once it has identified something as an enemy, it will continue beating them with its steel-hard pincers until there’s nothing left but scraps."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"１度 敵と 判断した ものは 鋼鉄の 硬さを もつ ハサミで 粉々になるまで 殴り続ける。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ses grandes pinces représentent un tiers de son poids. Un seul coup de l’une d’entre elles peut réduire un rocher en poussière."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Sus grandes pinzas representan un tercio de su peso corporal. Basta el impacto de una de ellas para reducir a escombros una enorme roca."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Bulky pincers account for one third of Scizor’s body weight. A single swing of one of these pincers will crush a boulder completely."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"大きな ハサミは 体重の ３分の１の 重さ。 振り下ろせば 岩石も 一発で 粉々だ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Malgré son corps fin, sa puissance de frappe est prodigieuse, car même ses muscles sont composés de métal."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Su potencia de ataque, que asombra dada su delgadez, se debe a que sus músculos están hechos de metal."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Though its body is slim, Scizor has tremendous attacking power. Even Scizor’s muscles are made of metal."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"体は 細いが 攻撃力は 凄まじい。 体の 筋肉も 金属で できているのだ。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"Evolved by way of a curious item. The shell covering its body has been shown to be stronger than forged steel."}],"varieties":[{"id":212,"moves":[{"name":"razor-wind","learns":[[8,"level-up",33],[9,"level-up",33],[10,"level-up",33],[11,"level-up",33],[14,"level-up",33],[15,"level-up",33],[16,"level-up",33],[17,"level-up",33],[18,"level-up",33]]},{"name":"swords-dance","learns":[[3,"level-up",42],[4,"level-up",42],[5,"level-up",36],[6,"level-up",36],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"level-up",36],[7,"tutor",0],[8,"level-up",57],[8,"machine",0],[9,"level-up",57],[9,"machine",0],[10,"level-up",57],[10,"machine",0],[11,"level-up",57],[11,"machine",0],[12,"level-up",36],[13,"level-up",36],[14,"level-up",57],[14,"machine",0],[15,"level-up",57],[15,"machine",0],[16,"level-up",57],[16,"machine",0],[17,"level-up",57],[17,"machine",0],[18,"level-up",57],[18,"machine",0],[20,"level-up",48],[20,"machine",0],[23,"level-up",48],[23,"m